			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Optime vir et mihi vere venerande, si scirem <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>me vel frequentia vel prolixitate epistolarum amicissim<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>am meam voluntatem et benevolentiam fraternam <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>posse declarare ac tibi de animo meo hac ratione <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>fidem firmare, non modo saepe, sed quantum per <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>miseras nostras occupationes licet, copiosissime <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>scriberem.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Verum cum, qua humanitate, pietate <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>et prudentia sis, non ignorem, boni consules, quod pro <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>tribus tuis epistolis hanc brevem et in magna festi<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>natione exaratam a me accipis.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Caput autem illius <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>hoc est me esse tuum et nos una in Christo esse optare <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>atque certissime sperare neque dubitare, quin tu in his <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>paucis verbis omnia esse statuas.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Meum carmen prae<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>positum doctissimis versibus <persName ref="p8033">Bezae</persName> non sine rubore <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>vidi.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Utinam vel ipsum <persName ref="p8033">Bezam</persName> vel saltem <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>epistolam ab eo scriptam videre mihi liceat; me <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>certe suorum scriptorum, quaecunque ad nos perferuntur, lectorem <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>studiosissimum habet.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Public te ab aliis malo <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>cognoscere; me enim de illis ne cogitacio quidem de<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>lectat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Bene ac foeliciter vale, vir praestantissime <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>et mihi carissime.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l18">Augustae</placeName> 13. maii 1566.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z22"/><persName ref="p8070">I[oannes] Crato</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Cum ad d. <persName ref="p8033">Bezam</persName> scribes, ut <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>eum meo nomine s[alutes] peto.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Quam hic sint misera omnia <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>nullis verbis nequeo exprimere.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Dominatur illa impia terque quate<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>rque<foreign xml:lang="el">πανταχουσία</foreign>, fidei nostrae calamitas<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Henrico <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Bullingero</persName> seniori, verbi <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>divini apud <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinos</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>ministro fidis[simo], domino et amico suo observando.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/><placeName ref="l587">Zurich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="author">[Bemerkung von <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Hand:]</note>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z7"/><persName ref="p8070">Ioannis Cratonis</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>imp[eratoris]medici, literae, <lb xml:id="p2z9"/><placeName ref="l18">Augustae</placeName> scriptae <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>13. maii 1566.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>